{
    "background_story": "Hattie was a respected witch in her coven, known for her deep understanding of the ancient traditions. She spent most of her days tending to her mystical garden, where she grew rare herbs and flowers used in the coven's rituals. As the full moon approached, Hattie began preparing for the upcoming sabbat, a sacred celebration of the summer solstice. She spent hours crafting intricate spells and brewing potions to ensure the ritual's success. On the night of the sabbat, Hattie led the coven in a powerful ceremony, calling upon the ancient gods to bless their lands and bring forth a bountiful harvest. Her devotion and expertise made the ritual a triumph, and the coven prospered under her guidance. Hattie's connection to the mystical forces was palpable, and her leadership during the sabbat was a testament to her spiritual power.",
